    <string name="lab_hci_title">Bluetooth HCI snoop log</string>
    <string name="lab_hci_body">To learn the real protocol, the owner can record the manufacturer’s app talking to the headphones: Android Settings → Developer options → Enable Bluetooth HCI snoop log, then use the manufacturer’s app for a minute and share the log from a bug report. Details are in docs/HCI_SNOOP.md. Sonic Control never reads this log itself.</string>
